fixture air_dash_up_45_ramp_rows
doc docs/adr/0008 decision 6 (round 3, H1): a hop then a level air dash right onto a four-row 45-degree ramp (test/review_ramp45). BUILD.md s5 "Up to 45 degrees, speed unchanged", "180 u in 9 f": the dash climbs past every tile-row boundary without stopping.
room test/review_ramp45
spawn 236 384
frames 24
input
  0 R jump
  1 R dash
  2..23 R
end
expect
  # 180 u in 9 f, every frame 20 u: the ramp changes no speed.
  at 9 xu=417 state=dash
  never 1..10 hit_wall!=0
end
